========================================================================
4. Models a voter's server may load
========================================================================

`laya-lab bench --voter` asks whatever model the operator's own server has
loaded. Such a model keeps its own licence, and it is the operator's to
check. A results file under bench/results/ records the licence the operator
stated for each voter (`licence=` in the voter spec), or none.
